From 6f991f56a50d228b2c2eebc8d6772e8778bcc97b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:16:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Floating panels: float, re-dock at a slot, detach to a window

- panelfloat.js: drag a panel by its title bar to float it, drop it on the dock
  to dock it at that slot (drop line), re-order docked panels the same way,
  double click / dot menu to dock at the original spot, layout remembered
- dropping a panel outside the window opens it as its own frameless window
  (desktop build); the DOM node moves, so every control keeps working
- main.js / preload.js: child window options and tv.panelWin (move/resize/close)
- ui.js: lookups go through qAny()/allDocs() so panels in other windows are found
- leftdock.js/css: menus open in the panel's own window, styles apply to floating panels

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012Pwj93PLpfdPHz7nps4p6z
